       "text": "RESULTS AND DISCUSSION"},
      {"type": "text", "bbox": [50, 80, 300, 300], "detailed_index": 1, "confirmed_index": 1,
       "text": "Identification of Compound 3. A screening campaign identified compound 3 as a D1R PAM with an EC50 of 1.2 \u03bcM in the cAMP assay."}
    ]
